1         ***** THE USAF AUTOMATED MISSILE DATCOM * REV 03/11 *****
               AERODYNAMIC METHODS FOR MISSILE CONFIGURATIONS     

    CONERR - INPUT ERROR CHECKING

    ERROR CODES - N* DENOTES THE NUMBER OF OCCURENCES OF EACH ERROR
    A - UNKNOWN VARIABLE NAME
    B - MISSING EQUAL SIGN FOLLOWING VARIABLE NAME
    C - NON-ARRAY VARIABLE HAS AN ARRAY ELEMENT DESIGNATION - (N)
    D - NON-ARRAY VARIABLE HAS MULTIPLE VALUES ASSIGNED
    E - ASSIGNED VALUES EXCEED ARRAY DIMENSION
    F - SYNTAX ERROR

    ************************* INPUT DATA CARDS *************************

   1 DIM M                                                                           
   2 DERIV DEG                                                                       
   3 DAMP                                                                            
   4 - -----------------------------------------------------------                   
        ** ERROR ** UNKNOWN CONTROL CARD - IGNORED
   5 - HYDRA 70 / APKWS II - MOTOR IGNITION CONFIGURATION (CANARDS CLOSED)           
        ** ERROR ** UNKNOWN CONTROL CARD - IGNORED
   6 - -----------------------------------------------------------                   
        ** ERROR ** UNKNOWN CONTROL CARD - IGNORED
   7  $FLTCON                                                                        
   8   NMACH=7.0, MACH(1)=0.5, 0.8, 1.2, 1.8, 2.5, 3.0, 3.5,                         
   9   NALPHA=6.0, ALPHA(1)=0.0, 2.0, 5.0, 10.0, 15.0, 20.0,                         
  10   ALT(1)=7*1000.0,                                                              
  11  $END                                                                           
  12  $REFQ                                                                          
  13   SREF=0.003848, LREF=0.07, LATREF=0.07,                                        
  14   XCG=1.05, ZCG=0.0,                                                            
  15  $END                                                                           
  16  $AXIBOD                                                                        
  17   TNOSE=OGIVE, LNOSE=0.41, DNOSE=0.07,                                          
               ** SUBSTITUTING NUMERIC FOR NAME OGIVE
  18   LCENTR=1.53, DCENTR=0.07,                                                     
  19  $END                                                                           
  20  $FINSET1                                                                       
  21   SECTYP=HEX, NPANEL=3.0,                                                       
               ** SUBSTITUTING NUMERIC FOR NAME HEX
  22   XLE=1.80,                                                                     
  23   SSPAN(1)=0.035, 0.11,                                                         
  24   CHORD(1)=0.15, 0.08,                                                          
  25   STA=0.0, SWEEP=25.0,                                                          
  26   PHIF(1)=0.0, 120.0, 240.0,                                                    
  27  $END                                                                           
  28 NEXT CASE                                                                       
1         ***** THE USAF AUTOMATED MISSILE DATCOM * REV 03/11 *****    CASE   1
               AERODYNAMIC METHODS FOR MISSILE CONFIGURATIONS          PAGE   1
    CASE INPUTS
    FOLLOWING ARE THE CARDS INPUT FOR THIS CASE

 DIM M                                                                           
 DERIV DEG                                                                       
 DAMP                                                                            
  $FLTCON                                                                        
   NMACH=7.0, MACH(1)=0.5, 0.8, 1.2, 1.8, 2.5, 3.0, 3.5,                         
   NALPHA=6.0, ALPHA(1)=0.0, 2.0, 5.0, 10.0, 15.0, 20.0,                         
   ALT(1)=7*1000.0,                                                              
  $END                                                                           
  $REFQ                                                                          
   SREF=0.003848, LREF=0.07, LATREF=0.07,                                        
   XCG=1.05, ZCG=0.0,                                                            
  $END                                                                           
  $AXIBOD                                                                        
   TNOSE=1., LNOSE=0.41, DNOSE=0.07,                                             
   LCENTR=1.53, DCENTR=0.07,                                                     
  $END                                                                           
  $FINSET1                                                                       
   SECTYP=0., NPANEL=3.0,                                                        
   XLE=1.80,                                                                     
   SSPAN(1)=0.035, 0.11,                                                         
   CHORD(1)=0.15, 0.08,                                                          
   STA=0.0, SWEEP=25.0,                                                          
   PHIF(1)=0.0, 120.0, 240.0,                                                    
  $END                                                                           
 NEXT CASE                                                                       
